\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
I'm sorry. The Doctor continues speaking. Care. Management. Future. Ken hears almost none of it. He looks toward his legs. They exist. He can see them. He cannot feel them. Not pressure. Not fabric. Nothing. The Doctor leaves. Ken stares upward. He had been a RUNNER first. Before reporting. Before newspapers. Before war. His family had relied on his body the way people rely on a wall. Something permanent. Unquestioned. Until it isn't. Ken looks at the ceiling. The thought arrives quietly. He has not told GENERAL MATSUI. Has not told KAZUO. Has not explained why he left his assignment. Why he came to Saka. Why he failed to deliver the photographs. Why he is here. The explanation itself feels impossible. Ken's eyes remain fixed upward. Then -- Something settles in him.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
KEN}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
Nothing. Barely audible. He is nothing now. No work. No running. No body capable of providing. No place in the military story he had constructed around himself. And in the broken hierarchy inside his mind -- Something even worse. He is beneath the Chinese. Ken stares at the ceiling. Then becomes aware -- Someone is standing at the foot of the bed.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
