\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
You think any woman like her would? Ken swallows. His brothers. His poor family. Years of care. A man who cannot work. Cannot run. Cannot provide. Cannot fulfill any of the obligations he has allowed other men to define as manhood. There is only one action left that still looks, to him, like control. Then -- MIN appears at the foot of the bed. LI-HUA in her arms. The baby exactly as Ken last saw her. Beside them --}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af7\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af6\langfe2052\loch\ql{\loch
